          "text": "Golf Wang's doin' amazing, might open up another store",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "​le FLEUR* is goin' insane, smell good, nail polish",
