          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I'm out here scorin' commercials, movies soon",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "We writin' shows, man, life is fucking beautiful",
          "rhyme": "9l",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I done fell in love and th-th-thе—",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "The only flaw is my fuckin' hair won't grow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "It's been like two years and this shit likе two inches",
          "rhyme": ")S",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Come get lost with me, man, come, come, come see the world",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "When you, when you really get out there, call me, I'll be there",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "And I don't take jets like that, I'm scared to go broke, so",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "I don't take none of this shit for granted",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
